  "type": "Component",
  "fields": {
    "name": "Table Valued Parameters",
    "responsibility": "Turns a list of models into a single SQL Server parameter carrying many rows, so that a set of records is saved in one round trip rather than one command per record. It compiles and caches, per model type, the projection that writes each model into a table row with the right column order and SQL types, declares which property marks a collection as such a parameter, and reports what it mapped and whether the projection was cached.",
